rustyneedle
Copyright rustyneedle contributors

This project is inspired by and compatible with Needle and Whistle by Cactus Compute
(https://github.com/cactus-compute/needle, Apache-2.0). It reimplements the runtime that reads
the .cact archive format and follows the behaviour of the Needle 3 and Whistle models published
by Cactus Compute. It is an independent project and is not affiliated with or endorsed by
Cactus Compute. The model weights are downloaded separately from Hugging Face and are subject to
their own licence; no model weights or recordings made from them are distributed here.

examples/environments/*.json hold the six tool environments and test cases of
https://github.com/cactus-compute/needle-environments (Apache-2.0), stored as data.

examples/tools/home_assistant.json is generated from English intent definitions published by the
Open Home Foundation (home-assistant/intents, (c) Open Home Foundation, licensed CC BY 4.0).
